{"seq":2,"slug":"convex-optimization","title":"凸优化基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/foundations/convex-optimization","wordCount":1676,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"凸优化基础\">凸优化基础</h1><p>有经验的优化工程师拿到一个新问题时，第一反应不是「用什么算法」，而是「它凸不凸」。这个问题的答案几乎决定了后续一切：凸问题能在多项式时间内求到真正的全局最优，而非凸问题可能让最先进的求解器困在一个糟糕的局部解里无法脱身。凸性是整个优化领域里最重要的一条分界线，本篇讲清它的几何直觉、判定方法与工程含义。问题分类的整体坐标系见<a href=\"optimization-formulation\">优化问题的形式化</a>，本篇专注凸性本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>凸性有两个层面：集合的凸与函数的凸。一个集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是凸集，当且仅当集合内任意两点的连线整段都落在集合内：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>θ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>θ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x, y \\in C, \\; \\theta \\in [0,1] \\implies \\theta x + (1-\\theta) y \\in C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直观地说，凸集没有「凹陷」或「孔洞」。圆盘、半空间、多面体都是凸集；甜甜圈、星形则不是。</p>\n<p>一个函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是凸函数，当且仅当它的图像上方区域（上境图）是凸集，等价于满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(\\theta x + (1-\\theta)y) \\le \\theta f(x) + (1-\\theta) f(y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>几何上，连接函数图像上任意两点的弦永远不低于这两点之间的函数曲线。抛物线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、负对数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\log x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 都是凸的。</p>\n<p>凸优化问题就是「凸目标 + 凸可行域」：最小化一个凸函数，约束围成的可行域是凸集。它之所以是优化领域的安全岛，源于一条黄金定理——凸问题的任何局部最优解都是全局最优解。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[凸优化问题] --&gt; B[凸目标函数 f]&#10;    A --&gt; C[凸可行域]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[不等式约束 g_i 为凸函数]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[等式约束 h_j 为仿射]&#10;    B --&gt; D[黄金性质]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[局部最优 = 全局最优]&#10;    E --&gt; F[求解器停机即得真最优解]\">graph TD\n    A[凸优化问题] --&gt; B[凸目标函数 f]\n    A --&gt; C[凸可行域]\n    C --&gt; C1[不等式约束 g_i 为凸函数]\n    C --&gt; C2[等式约束 h_j 为仿射]\n    B --&gt; D[黄金性质]\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[局部最优 = 全局最优]\n    E --&gt; F[求解器停机即得真最优解]</pre><p>下表对照凸与非凸问题在工程上的根本差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>凸问题</th>\n<th>非凸问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>局部最优</td>\n<td>必为全局最优</td>\n<td>可能远离全局最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>求解保证</td>\n<td>多项式时间收敛到最优</td>\n<td>一般无全局保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>初值依赖</td>\n<td>不依赖初值</td>\n<td>强烈依赖初值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型方法</td>\n<td>内点法、一阶法</td>\n<td>多起点、<a href=\"../nonlinear-metaheuristic/metaheuristics\">元启发式</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>停机判据</td>\n<td><a href=\"duality-kkt\">KKT 条件</a>即最优</td>\n<td>KKT 仅为必要条件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么凸性等于可解\">为什么凸性等于可解</h2><p>凸性的价值不在于它「好看」，而在于它消灭了优化中最致命的敌人——局部最优陷阱。考虑一个非凸函数的曲面，它像连绵的山谷，有许多低洼处。一个只会「往下走」的算法到达任何一个低洼就停了，但这个低洼可能比真正的谷底高出许多。算法无法分辨自己是停在了世界最低点还是某个不起眼的小坑里。</p>\n<p>凸函数的曲面只有一个碗状的底。无论从哪里出发往下走，都会滑到同一个全局最低点。这就是「局部最优即全局最优」的几何来源。它带来三个工程上的直接好处：求解器停下来时给出的就是真答案，不必担心被骗；结果不依赖初始猜测，可复现性强；算法的收敛速度有理论保证，能预估求解时间。</p>\n<p>这条性质的反面同样重要。当你的模型是非凸的——比如神经网络训练、含整数变量的<a href=\"../linear-integer/integer-programming-bnb\">整数规划</a>——你必须接受「拿到的可能只是局部解」这个现实，并相应地采用多次随机重启、或专门的全局优化技术。识别凸性，本质上是在判断「我能否相信求解器给我的答案」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么判断一个问题是凸的\">怎么判断一个问题是凸的</h2><p>判定凸性是建模阶段的关键技能。对二阶可微函数，最实用的判据是 Hessian 矩阵半正定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mtext> 凸</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⪰</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f \\text{ 凸} \\iff \\nabla^2 f(x) \\succeq 0 \\; \\forall x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">凸</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⪰</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即 Hessian 的所有特征值非负。一维情形退化为大家熟悉的二阶导数非负 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;&#x27;(x) \\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的二阶导恒为 2，凸；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=x^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的二阶导 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 在负半轴为负，非凸。</p>\n<p>但逐个验算 Hessian 既繁琐又容易出错。实践中更高效的是「凸性演算」——从一组已知的凸函数原子出发，用保凸运算搭积木。核心规则包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>非负加权和：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_1, f_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 凸且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha,\\beta\\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha f_1 + \\beta f_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 凸。</li>\n<li>逐点最大：若每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 凸，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_i f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 凸。</li>\n<li>仿射复合：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 凸，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(Ax+b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 凸。</li>\n<li>凸函数与非降凸函数的复合保凸。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>只要你的目标函数能由凸原子经这些规则拼出，它就一定是凸的，无需碰 Hessian。这正是 CVXPY 这类「凸优化建模工具」背后的原理——它通过约束你只能用保凸规则组装模型，自动保证问题可解，相关工具链见<a href=\"../practice/modeling-solvers\">建模语言与求解器</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[拿到一个函数 f] --&gt; B{能否由凸原子&lt;br/&gt;经保凸规则拼出?}&#10;    B --&gt;|能| C[凸, 可放心求解]&#10;    B --&gt;|不确定| D{二阶可微?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[检查 Hessian 是否半正定]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[检查弦不低于曲线定义]&#10;    E --&gt;|半正定| C&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[非凸, 需全局/局部策略]\">flowchart TD\n    A[拿到一个函数 f] --&gt; B{能否由凸原子&lt;br/&gt;经保凸规则拼出?}\n    B --&gt;|能| C[凸, 可放心求解]\n    B --&gt;|不确定| D{二阶可微?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[检查 Hessian 是否半正定]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[检查弦不低于曲线定义]\n    E --&gt;|半正定| C\n    E --&gt;|否| G[非凸, 需全局/局部策略]</pre><h2 id=\"凸问题的重要子类\">凸问题的重要子类</h2><p>并非所有凸问题难度相同，它们构成一个从易到难的谱系，识别子类有助于挑选最专门、最快的求解器。</p>\n<p>最底层是线性规划 LP，目标与约束都是线性（仿射）函数，它既是凸的也是组合结构特殊的，有专门的<a href=\"../linear-integer/linear-programming-simplex\">单纯形法</a>。往上是二次规划 QP，目标是凸二次函数、约束线性，投资组合优化是其代表。再往上是二阶锥规划 SOCP 与半定规划 SDP，能表达带范数、带矩阵特征值的约束，控制论与信号处理常用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子类</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性规划 LP</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>资源分配、运输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二次规划 QP</td>\n<td>凸二次</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>投资组合、SVM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二阶锥 SOCP</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>锥约束</td>\n<td>鲁棒优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半定规划 SDP</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>矩阵半正定</td>\n<td>控制、组合松弛</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个谱系的实践意义是：越靠下的子类，求解器越专门、越快。把一个问题识别为 QP 而非一般凸优化，往往能换来数量级的加速。建模时应尽量把问题「往下压」到最特殊的子类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>凸性分两层：凸集（任意两点连线在集合内）与凸函数（弦不低于曲线）；凸优化是凸目标加凸可行域。</li>\n<li>黄金性质「局部最优即全局最优」让凸问题能被可靠求解，不依赖初值、收敛有保证——这是凸与非凸的根本分水岭。</li>\n<li>判定凸性可查 Hessian 半正定，但更高效的是凸性演算：用保凸规则从凸原子拼出目标函数。</li>\n<li>凸问题有 LP、QP、SOCP、SDP 的子类谱系，越特殊越快；建模时应把问题压到最特殊的子类。</li>\n<li>凸性的最优性刻画依赖<a href=\"duality-kkt\">对偶与 KKT 条件</a>，非凸问题的应对手段见<a href=\"../nonlinear-metaheuristic/metaheuristics\">元启发式</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"凸优化基础","id":"凸优化基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么凸性等于可解","id":"为什么凸性等于可解"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么判断一个问题是凸的","id":"怎么判断一个问题是凸的"},{"level":2,"text":"凸问题的重要子类","id":"凸问题的重要子类"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"优化问题的形式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/foundations/optimization-formulation"},"next":{"title":"对偶与 KKT 条件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/foundations/duality-kkt"}}